  "description": "Create striking modern designs with this neon grid seamless pattern featuring vivid pink, yellow, blue, and green. The bold geometric layout pairs brilliant rose, chartreuse, han purple, and medium spring green to create a high-energy color combination with a futuristic, playful edge. Perfect for contemporary digital artwork, bold backgrounds, and retro-inspired graphics, this repeating grid pattern adds structure without sacrificing color or personality. Use it to bring an electric touch to stationery, packaging, printable projects, and creative designs that demand attention.\n✨What’s Included:\n• 15 seamless patterns\n• Format: JPEG\n• Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n• High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n• Scrapbooking and junk journals\n• Digital paper and printable backgrounds\n• Fabric prints and textile designs\n• Wrapping paper and gift packaging\n• Planners, notebooks, and stationery\n• Y2K, retro, and pop art projects\n• Party invitations and decorations\n• Stickers, cards, and crafts\n• Social media graphics and digital collages\n• Bold branding and creative DIY projects",
